      ],
      "text": "Version 9.x.x Release Date: 2026-09-01 GitHub Release: 9.1.2 Docker Hub (valkey/valkey) Tags: valkey/valkey:9.1.2 valkey/valkey:9.1.2-trixie valkey/valkey:9.1.2-alpine valkey/valkey:9.1.2-alpine3.24 Example: docker run --rm valkey/valkey:9.1.2 Binary Artifacts arm64 / jammy (sha256) x86_64 / jammy (sha256) arm64 / noble (sha256) x86_64 / noble (sha256) Latest supported version of past releases Version 8.x.x Release Date: 2026-09-01 GitHub Release: 8.1.10 Docker Hub (valkey/valkey) Tags: valkey/valkey:8.1.10 valkey/valkey:8.1.10-trixie valkey/valkey:8.1.10-alpine valkey/valkey:8.1.10-alpine3.24",
